            </note>
            <note corresp="#d460-f2" n="2" xml:id="d460-f2-content">
                <p><ref target="#d459"><hi rendition="#italic">Supra</hi></ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d460-f3" n="3" xml:id="d460-f3-content">
                <p>Not further identified.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d460-f4" n="4" xml:id="d460-f4-content">
                <p>In telegram 522 to Vientiane, November 17, the Department of State responded that
                    it was aware of the dangers Brown
                    outlined, and was seeking a way of handling the issue to avoid Brown’s worse fears. (Department of State,
                    Central Files, 751J.00/11–1760; included in <ref
                        target="frus1958-60v15-16mSupp1">the microfiche supplement</ref>)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
